-- COMPARING DIFFERENT TYPES ------------------------------------ main.kl  K0602

I can't compare a value of type `Point` with one of type `Size` using `==`. Equality needs two values of the same type, and that type must support equality (`Eq`).

10│     let same = p == s
                   ^^^^^^

Help: Convert one side so both have the same type, or compare fields that support equality. Compare secrets with `crypto.equal(a, b)`.

Learn more: kalam explain K0602
